  <h2>About</h2>

<p>
  My name is Patrik Harag, I live in Pilsen, Czech Republic, where I also studied software engineering and now work as a software developer in one of the local companies.
  I have many interests and hobbies, and one of them is programming, which has been a hobby of mine for years before I started studying IT and became a professional.
  And it was just for fun that the Sand Saga gradually came into existence in my free time.
</p>

<p>
